  "sentences": [
    {"text": "Almost overnight, the cherry trees burst into flower, and delicate, pink blossom foamed along every branch.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Tender, green shoots pushed through the cold earth as though they had been waiting for a signal.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Fat, sticky buds swelled on every twig of the chestnut.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Bright, golden daffodils nodded in the breeze along the verge.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Frisky, new-born lambs gambolled across the meadow on legs that still surprised them.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Hyacinths scented the morning air.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "A mild, gentle breeze carried the smell of wet earth and growing things.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Sudden, sparkling showers pattered on the new leaves and were gone in minutes.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Bluebells carpeted the woodland floor in a haze of violet-blue.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "A jubilant chorus of birdsong trilled from the hedgerows before the sun was up.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Crumpled, emerald leaves unfurled in the sunshine, each one like a new butterfly's wing.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Meltwater trickled down the hillside in a hundred bright threads.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Soft, pastel petals drifted to the ground like confetti.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The last, grey patches of snow lingered in the hollows where the sun never reached.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Wild, blustery gusts whipped the blossom from the trees and sent it whirling down the street.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "A late, bitter frost blackened the tender shoots in a single night.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "After months of stillness, the garden stirred back into life.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Fresh, verdant meadows stretched to the river, starred with buttercups.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Frothy, white hawthorn turned every hedge into a breaking wave.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Pale, dewy primroses clustered on the bank beneath the hazels.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The ice on the pond thawed at last, and the ducks returned.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Sap rose in the birches, and catkins hung like lambs' tails from the hazel.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Fledglings lined up on the fence, shouting to be fed.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Every puddle in the lane held a piece of blue sky, and the children jumped in all of them.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "March came in roaring, rattling the windows and bowling hats down the road.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Spring was fleeting that year, a fortnight of fragile colour between the frost and the heat.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The blossom came as it always did, though there was no one left in the house to see it.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The raw wind of early spring found every gap in his coat.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The first warm day arrived like a held breath let go.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Crocuses and snowdrops awoke beneath the saplings.", "vibe": "General"}
